## Shadow run

The overseer compares your verdict with its own before the steward is allowed to act, so this run decides and changes nothing. Do every step that reads, merges, builds or tests inside your worktree. Where a step would push, requeue, re-sling, change labels or notes, or escalate, do none of it: say in your comment what you would have done, and report the outcome that action would have had. Your outputs are one comment on `{{ .Bead }}`, whose verdict begins `STEWARD (shadow)`, and the verdict file.

{{ end -}}
